# Writer 12 (session 7c, T-1). L §5.14.1 The leg read's class (R-10): "`m.leg.amount of q` reads booking state, as a
# balance does: in a def no movement reaches, or an ask, after the walk". L §5.14 The leg read: "what leg `leg` of
# movement m took at its `from` place from the parts labelled q". The movement may be a decision: h (`reads k1`) takes
# bal(k1) of tomek, all of tomek's 100.00 (w1's wage, labelled tomek's by the base rule), so h.cash.amount of tomek is
# 100.00 PLN (writer 12's scratch/exp_t1.py). refcore had refused RUN-RECORD h has no leg cash (triage scratch a2/t1).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
kind savings: place PLN min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(PLN)
  takes k for w order if w in gifts and k.owner == w.giver then 0 else 1, if k.owner == ania then 0 else 1
kind gifts: transfers
  attr giver: key persons
  attr receiver: key persons
place k1: savings lives 2026-01-01..
place k2: savings lives 2026-01-01..
index ks = [a, b]
place acct[j in ks]: savings lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_day: date
input g_day: date
input wage_amt: money PLN
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule base = if p == tomek then 1 else 0
  rule gift beats base = if p == m.receiver then 1 else 0 when m in gifts
move w1[x in savings on wage_day]: transfers
  on wage_day
  leg cash from world to x amount wage_amt
move h: transfers
  on g_day
  reads k1
  leg cash from k1 to world amount bal(k1) of tomek
ask q1: h.cash.amount of tomek
ask q2: h.cash.amount

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1981-01-01..
  opening[k1] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[k2] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[acct[a]] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[acct[b]] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  wage_day = 2026-02-01
  wage_amt = 100.00 PLN
  g_day = 2026-03-01
=== expect
q1: 100.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: w1[k1]
  cut 2026-12-31
q2: 100.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: w1[k1]
  cut 2026-12-31
